"""cairn-node: the node side of Cairn. Stdlib only, Python 3.11+.

Commands (all print JSON; failure prints {"error": ...} and exits 1):
  snapshot | read <project> <relpath> | init <project> | start <project> [--model A] [--subagent-model A]
  relead <project> | usage <project>
  stop <project> | review <project> | pane <project> [--review]
  ticket <project>   (stdin: one JSON op: create | close | out-of-scope | blockers)
  chat <project> [--resume]   (stdin: token line, then claude stream-json; execs claude)
  answer <project>   (stdin: {"id", "choice", "note", "fingerprint" (optional)})
  dialog <project> | dialog-answer <project> <fingerprint> <n>
"""
